               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Once per day when you finish a short rest, you can choose expen</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Once per day when you finish a short rest, you can choose expended spell slots to recover. The spell slots can have a combined level that is equal to or less than half your wizard level, and none of the slots can be 6th level or higher.</photoshop:LayerText>
